§§ `cl 47: measured by the costs agreement`

#ASSERT `Will the adjudication follow my costs agreement` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `yes: the court must adjudicate the disputed costs by the terms of your costs agreement (cl 47(1))`
#ASSERT `Will the adjudication follow my costs agreement` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: the agreement does not specify the amount, or a rate or other means of calculating it, for these costs (cl 47(1)(a))`
#ASSERT `Will the adjudication follow my costs agreement` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: the agreement has been set aside (cll 30, 47(1)(b))`
#ASSERT `Will the adjudication follow my costs agreement` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: the court is satisfied that the agreement does not comply in a material respect with the disclosure requirements of Part 3 (cl 47(1)(c))`
#ASSERT `Will the adjudication follow my costs agreement` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `no: the court is satisfied that Part 5 stops the law practice recovering these costs (cl 47(1)(d))`
#ASSERT `Will the adjudication follow my costs agreement` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no: you and the law practice agreed otherwise (cl 47(1)(e))`

§§ `cl 49: the costs of the adjudication`

#ASSERT `Who pays the costs of the adjudication` 10000 8500 FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the law practice: the costs were reduced by 15% or more, unless the court orders otherwise (cl 49(2)(a))`
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs of the adjudication` 10000 8501 FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `you, as the applicant, unless the court orders otherwise (cl 49(3))`
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs of the adjudication` 10000 8501 TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the law practice: the court is satisfied it failed to comply with Part 3, unless the court orders otherwise (cl 49(2)(b))`
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs of the adjudication` 10000 5000 FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `you, as the applicant: you applied after the Commissioner's determination under section 77N, unless the court orders otherwise (cl 49(4))`
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs of the adjudication` 10000 8600 FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the law practice, as the applicant, unless the court orders otherwise (cl 49(3))`
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs of the adjudication` 10000 10000 FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `you, as the applicant, unless the court orders otherwise (cl 49(3))`
